| `{colors.faculty-orange}` | 165 C | M73 Y87 | `#ff671f` | orange |
| `{colors.faculty-red}` | 1795 C | C18 M95 Y84 | `#d22730` | red |
| `{colors.faculty-rose}` | 7607 C | C27 M69 Y57 | `#ba4f6e` | rose |
| `{colors.faculty-wine}` | 4985 C | C53 M78 Y62 K10 | `#6c3257` | wine-rose |
| `{colors.faculty-periwinkle}` | 7680 C | C46 M45 Y26 | `#8a8cbd` | periwinkle |
