| `{colors.faculty-olive}` | 105 C | C54 M51 Y100 K4 | `#717800` | olive |
| `{colors.faculty-mint}` | 7542 C | C33 M14 Y25 | `#abdbbf` | pale mint |
| `{colors.faculty-turquoise}` | 319 C | C67 Y26 | `#54ffbd` | turquoise |
