**Neutral & metallic ladder** (the grays already power core surfaces; metallics are ceremonial):
| Token | Pantone | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| `{colors.cloud}` | Cool Gray 1 C | `#d9d9d6` | lightest band |
| `{colors.fog}` | Cool Gray 2–3 C | `#e6e6e3` | section band |
